# Grind: the numbers are the plot.
#
# Stats, levels, loot and optimisation. Excludes `soft` magic systems only where the tag says so:
# a fic tagged gamer but not progression is a comedy far more often than a grind.

(tag:gamer OR tag:system OR tag:litrpg OR tag:stat-grinding OR tag:levelling)
AND (tag:progression OR tag:power-fantasy OR tag:overpowered)
AND NOT tag:fluff
AND NOT tag:crack
